#. Tag: title
#: nonkdeapps.docbook:8
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kde; with non-&kde; applications"
msgstr "&kde; con programa que no sexan de &kde;"

#. Tag: para
#: nonkdeapps.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"My non-&kde; applications like &Emacs; and <application>kterm</application> "
"are running amok with strange colors!"
msgstr ""
"Os programas que non son de &kde;, como &Emacs; e <application>kterm</"
"application> teñen cores estrañas!"

#. Tag: para
#: nonkdeapps.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Start the <application>&kde; Control Center</application> and in "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Appearance &amp; Themes</guimenu><guimenuitem> Colors</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> uncheck the <guilabel>Apply colors to non-KDE "
"applications</guilabel> checkbox and click <guibutton>Apply</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"Inicie o <application>Centro de control de &kde;</application> e en "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Aparencia e temas</guimenu><guimenuitem>Cores</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> desmarque a opción <guilabel>Aplicar as cores aos "
"programas que non sexan de KDE</guilabel> e prema en <guibutton>Aplicar</"
"guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: nonkdeapps.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How can I set my default web browser to be something other than &konqueror;?"
msgstr ""
"Como podo facer que o navegador web predeterminado sexa outro distinto de "
"&konqueror;?"

#. Tag: para
#: nonkdeapps.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are using &kde; 3.3 or later, open up the &kcontrolcenter; and "
"navigate to the <menuchoice><guimenu>KDE Components</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Component Chooser</guimenuitem></menuchoice> panel. "
"Select <guilabel>Web Browser</guilabel> from the list on the left, then "
"select <guilabel>Open http and https URLs in the following browser:</"
"guilabel> and type in the name of the browser (&eg; <application>mozilla</"
"application>, <application>firefox</application>, <application>opera</"
"application>, &etc;) in the textbox."
msgstr ""
"Se está a empregar &kde; 3.3 ou posterior, abra o &kcontrolcenter; e vaia ao "
"painel <menuchoice><guimenu>Componentes de KDE</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Selector de componentes</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. "
"Escolla <guilabel>Navegador web</guilabel> na lista da esquerda, logo "
"escolla <guilabel>Abrir os URL http e https no seguinte navegador:</"
"guilabel> e escreba o nome do navegador (&eg; <application>mozilla</"
"application>, <application>firefox</application>, <application>opera</"
"application> &etc;) no campo de texto."

#. Tag: para
#: nonkdeapps.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How can I configure the style and fonts of <acronym>GTK</acronym> "
"applications within &kde; ?"
msgstr ""
"Como podo configurar o estilo e tipos de letra dos programas baseados en "
"<acronym>GTK</acronym> desde &kde;?"

#. Tag: para
#: nonkdeapps.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The simplest way to achieve this is to download and compile the <acronym>gtk-"
"qt</acronym> theme engine from <ulink url=\"http://www.freedesktop.org/"
"Software/gtk-qt\"> http://www.freedesktop.org/Software/gtk-qt</ulink>. This "
"theme engine makes your <acronym>GTK</acronym> applications look like your "
"&kde; widget style by calling functions from &Qt; instead of drawing the "
"styles itself. Once the theme engine has been installed, there will be a "
"&kcontrolcenter; module under <menuchoice><guimenu>Appearance &amp; Themes</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>GTK Styles and Fonts</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"O xeito máis sinxelo de facer isto é obter o compilar o motor de temas "
"<acronym>gtk-qt</acronym> desde <ulink url=\"http://www.freedesktop.org/"
"Software/gtk-qt\">http://www.freedesktop.org/Software/gtk-qt</ulink>. Este "
"motor de temas fará que os programas de <acronym>GTK</acronym> teñan a mesma "
"aparencia que o estilo de widgets de &kde; chamando a funcións de &Qt; no "
"canto de debuxar os estilos en si. Cando teña instalado o motor de temas, "
"aparecerá un módulo do &kcontrolcenter; en <menuchoice><guimenu>Aparencia e "
"temas</guimenu><guimenuitem>Estilos e fontes GTK</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
